           <table width="82%" border="0" align="center" cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0">
  <tr>
    <td height="30" align="left" style="font-size:14px"><a href="/1/571/571300.htm" target="_blank" title="1.6万！华为发Mate RS保时捷设计：512GB+屏下指纹"><span class="title1">1.6万！华为发Mate RS保时捷设计：512GB+屏下指纹</span></a>　<img src="/images/c-l-g-t-01.gif" width="12" height="11" /> <span class="f12g">上方文Q</span> <img src="/images/c-l-g-t-02.gif" width="12" height="11" /> <span class="f12g">23:20:53</span></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td align="left"><p>除了P20、P20 Pro，华为今天还发布了一款绝对堪称神机的&ldquo;<strong>Mate RS保时捷设计</strong>&rdquo;，强大得不像话，贵得也不像话。</p>
<p align="center"><a href="/img/20180327/fee6a78ba7b24f92a074f657ae72d5e7.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="1.6万！华为发Mate RS保时捷设计：512GB+屏下指纹" src="/img/20180327/s_fee6a78ba7b24f92a074f657ae72d5e7.jpg" style="border-top: black 1px solid; border-right: black 1px solid; border-bottom: black 1px solid; border-left: black 1px solid" /></a></p>
<p>型号中的RS，代表<strong>Race Sports(赛车运动)</strong>，代表为赛道而生，灵感基于保时捷911流体机身设计。</p>
<p align="center"><strong><strong><a href="/img/20180327/b38c4be42b9347f1b44aa3a16c2628bf.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="1.6万！华为发Mate RS保时捷设计：512GB+屏下指纹" src="/img/20180327/s_b38c4be42b9347f1b44aa3a16c2628bf.jpg" style="border-top: black 1px solid; border-right: black 1px solid; border-bottom: black 1px solid; border-left: black 1px solid" /></a></strong></strong></p>
<p><strong>该机由华为、保时捷设计、徕卡联合设计，一体式极简风格，八曲面3D玻璃机身，玄黑、瑞红两种色彩风格，支持IP67防水防尘。</strong></p>
<p align="center"><strong><strong><a href="/img/20180327/050ef7e546ce40ce84f5835fbb2e7a82.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="1.6万！华为发Mate RS保时捷设计：512GB+屏下指纹" src="/img/20180327/s_050ef7e546ce40ce84f5835fbb2e7a82.jpg" style="border-top: black 1px solid; border-right: black 1px solid; border-bottom: black 1px solid; border-left: black 1px solid" /></a></strong></strong></p>
<p align="center"><strong><strong><a href="/img/20180327/71402f8d139940a193fbf4c842b63ae6.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="1.6万！华为发Mate RS保时捷设计：512GB+屏下指纹" src="/img/20180327/s_71402f8d139940a193fbf4c842b63ae6.jpg" style="border-top: black 1px solid; border-right: black 1px solid; border-bottom: black 1px solid; border-left: black 1px solid" /></a></strong></strong></p>
<p align="center"><strong><strong><a href="/img/20180327/5bbf53e773bd4b419903b49b20b079af.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="1.6万！华为发Mate RS保时捷设计：512GB+屏下指纹" src="/img/20180327/s_5bbf53e773bd4b419903b49b20b079af.jpg" style="border-top: black 1px solid; border-right: black 1px solid; border-bottom: black 1px solid; border-left: black 1px solid" /></a></strong></strong></p>
<p>它没有使用刘海屏，而是额头和下巴极窄的传统全面屏，<strong>一块6英寸OLED曲面屏，分辨率2K级别，高宽比为18:9</strong>，下巴上还有PORSCHE DESIGN的字样，上下两个SLS扬声器(杜比Atmos)。</p>
<p align="center"><strong><strong><a href="/img/20180327/d25b99840139444385deb77dd80fe985.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="1.6万！华为发Mate RS保时捷设计：512GB+屏下指纹" src="/img/20180327/s_d25b99840139444385deb77dd80fe985.jpg" style="border-top: black 1px solid; border-right: black 1px solid; border-bottom: black 1px solid; border-left: black 1px solid" /></a></strong></strong></p>
<p align="center"><strong><strong><a href="/img/20180327/14fdd42e800f425397043ea5a67e1c38.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="1.6万！华为发Mate RS保时捷设计：512GB+屏下指纹" src="/img/20180327/s_14fdd42e800f425397043ea5a67e1c38.jpg" style="border-top: black 1px solid; border-right: black 1px solid; border-bottom: black 1px solid; border-left: black 1px solid" /></a></strong></strong></p>
<p><strong>指纹识别模块放置在背部，但同时还有屏下指纹，可以悬浮感知，这也是<span style="color: #ff0000">第一次见到屏下＋后置双指纹方案</span>，并支持人脸识别解锁。</strong></p>
<p align="center"><strong><strong><strong><strong><a href="/img/20180327/854762251c44475d8821ab6cac713564.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="1.6万！华为发Mate RS保时捷设计：512GB+屏下指纹" src="/img/20180327/s_854762251c44475d8821ab6cac713564.jpg" style="border-top: black 1px solid; border-right: black 1px solid; border-bottom: black 1px solid; border-left: black 1px solid" /></a></strong></strong></strong></strong></p>
<p align="center"><strong><strong><strong><strong><a href="/img/20180327/7731260c211f4411bd8f7ab863559ac8.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="1.6万！华为发Mate RS保时捷设计：512GB+屏下指纹" src="/img/20180327/s_7731260c211f4411bd8f7ab863559ac8.jpg" style="border-top: black 1px solid; border-right: black 1px solid; border-bottom: black 1px solid; border-left: black 1px solid" /></a></strong></strong></strong></strong></p>
<p>后置额P20 Pro一样也是<strong>徕卡三摄像头</strong>，不过安排在居中垂直排列，从上到下分别是<strong>2000万像素黑白、4000万像素RGB彩色、800万像素长焦</strong>，支持5倍混合变焦，ISO高达102400。</p>
<p align="center"><strong><strong><a href="/img/20180327/097c5df3e449400aa164c160724920d5.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="1.6万！华为发Mate RS保时捷设计：512GB+屏下指纹" src="/img/20180327/s_097c5df3e449400aa164c160724920d5.jpg" style="border-top: black 1px solid; border-right: black 1px solid; border-bottom: black 1px solid; border-left: black 1px solid" /></a></strong></strong></p>
<p>处理器为麒麟970，内存6GB，存储256/5125GB，这也是<span style="color: #ff0000"><strong>史上第一款512GB存储的手机。</strong></span></p>
<p><strong>电池容量4000mAh，支持4.5V/5A/22.5W有线超级快充，以及10W无线快充。</strong></p>
<p align="center"><strong><strong><strong><a href="/img/20180327/7d178b690962414489130962ffc7a9f9.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="1.6万！华为发Mate RS保时捷设计：512GB+屏下指纹" src="/img/20180327/s_7d178b690962414489130962ffc7a9f9.jpg" style="border-top: black 1px solid; border-right: black 1px solid; border-bottom: black 1px solid; border-left: black 1px solid" /></a></strong></strong></strong></p>
<p>内部散热首次在智能手机上使用了<strong>来自航天领域的微胶囊相变散热技术</strong>，部署多达940万个微胶囊来控制发热。&nbsp;</p>
<p align="center"><strong><strong><a href="/img/20180327/3a28d68aa02c45f594c64eaeace82c57.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="1.6万！华为发Mate RS保时捷设计：512GB+屏下指纹" src="/img/20180327/s_3a28d68aa02c45f594c64eaeace82c57.jpg" style="border-top: black 1px solid; border-right: black 1px solid; border-bottom: black 1px solid; border-left: black 1px solid" /></a></strong></strong></p>
<p>价格方面，<span style="color: #ff0000"><strong>6GB+256GB 1695欧元(约合人民币1.32万元)，6GB+512GB 2095欧元(约合人民币1.63万元)</strong></span>，4月12日上市，另外还可选购高级皮套。</p>
<p align="center"><strong><strong><a href="/img/20180327/458b123d638c4056ac15e6590e26d6af.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="1.6万！华为发Mate RS保时捷设计：512GB+屏下指纹" src="/img/20180327/s_458b123d638c4056ac15e6590e26d6af.jpg" style="border-top: black 1px solid; border-right: black 1px solid; border-bottom: black 1px solid; border-left: black 1px solid" /></a></strong></strong></p>
<p align="center"><strong><a href="/img/20180327/8c0050c6344541b7a6a4295dc0d6d499.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="1.6万！华为发Mate RS保时捷设计：512GB+屏下指纹" src="/img/20180327/s_8c0050c6344541b7a6a4295dc0d6d499.jpg" style="border-top: black 1px solid; border-right: black 1px solid; border-bottom: black 1px solid; border-left: black 1px solid" /></a></strong></p>
<p><strong>华为P20、P20 Pro、Mate RS保时捷设计的国行版本，都将于4月12日在上海发布。</strong></p>
<p align="center"><strong><a href="/img/20180327/d1bab4ccefbd4387bbd5972e5e30f788.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="1.6万！华为发Mate RS保时捷设计：512GB+屏下指纹" src="/img/20180327/s_d1bab4ccefbd4387bbd5972e5e30f788.jpg" style="border-top: black 1px solid; border-right: black 1px solid; border-bottom: black 1px solid; border-left: black 1px solid" /></a></strong></p>
<p align="center"><strong><a href="/img/20180327/9ac69d7aa8d34ad9b09c18d82c9cd68b.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="1.6万！华为发Mate RS保时捷设计：512GB+屏下指纹" src="/img/20180327/s_9ac69d7aa8d34ad9b09c18d82c9cd68b.jpg" style="border-top: black 1px solid; border-right: black 1px solid; border-bottom: black 1px solid; border-left: black 1px solid" /></a></strong></p>
<p align="center"><strong><a href="/img/20180327/1eb62b077cab41698bb9cee87254867b.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="1.6万！华为发Mate RS保时捷设计：512GB+屏下指纹" src="/img/20180327/s_1eb62b077cab41698bb9cee87254867b.jpg" style="border-top: black 1px solid; border-right: black 1px solid; border-bottom: black 1px solid; border-left: black 1px solid" /></a></strong></p>
<p align="center"><strong><a href="/img/20180327/ecdfacf3a4f94a07a6218c16a66d7180.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="1.6万！华为发Mate RS保时捷设计：512GB+屏下指纹" src="/img/20180327/s_ecdfacf3a4f94a07a6218c16a66d7180.jpg" style="border-top: black 1px solid; border-right: black 1px solid; border-bottom: black 1px solid; border-left: black 1px solid" /></a></strong></p>
<p align="center"><strong><a href="/img/20180327/bdddd920f67346a9bf4fb86bdbb860dc.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="1.6万！华为发Mate RS保时捷设计：512GB+屏下指纹" src="/img/20180327/s_bdddd920f67346a9bf4fb86bdbb860dc.jpg" style="border-top: black 1px solid; border-right: black 1px solid; border-bottom: black 1px solid; border-left: black 1px solid" /></a></strong></p>
</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><hr align="center" color="#ffffff" size="1" /></td>
  </tr>
