<p align="center"><a href="/img/20180327/850f8addecbc448a81add4a6a47becbf.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="秒中毒！小米MIX 2S官方美图赏：四曲面陶瓷惊艳" src="/img/20180327/s_850f8addecbc448a81add4a6a47becbf.jpg" style="border-bottom: black 1px solid; border-left: black 1px solid; border-top: black 1px solid; border-right: black 1px solid" /></a></p>
