<p align="center"><a href="/img/20180327/0111cf46b2e646788bdfc94400058e45.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="秒中毒！小米MIX 2S官方美图赏：四曲面陶瓷惊艳" src="/img/20180327/s_0111cf46b2e646788bdfc94400058e45.jpg" style="border-bottom: black 1px solid; border-left: black 1px solid; border-top: black 1px solid; border-right: black 1px solid" /></a></p>
<p align="center"><a href="/img/20180327/523723a33ec4416e9084a9eba83039a9.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="秒中毒！小米MIX 2S官方美图赏：四曲面陶瓷惊艳" src="/img/20180327/s_523723a33ec4416e9084a9eba83039a9.jpg" style="border-bottom: black 1px solid; border-left: black 1px solid; border-top: black 1px solid; border-right: black 1px solid" /></a></p>
<p align="center"><a href="/img/20180327/a30eb7686c844ed1b74c37891cf9d2ed.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="秒中毒！小米MIX 2S官方美图赏：四曲面陶瓷惊艳" src="/img/20180327/s_a30eb7686c844ed1b74c37891cf9d2ed.jpg" style="border-bottom: black 1px solid; border-left: black 1px solid; border-top: black 1px solid; border-right: black 1px solid" /></a></p>
<p align="center"><a href="/img/20180327/23b14b5c982d4faa8380f4aa52e49927.png" target="_blank"><img alt="秒中毒！小米MIX 2S官方美图赏：四曲面陶瓷惊艳" src="/img/20180327/s_23b14b5c982d4faa8380f4aa52e49927.png" style="border-bottom: black 1px solid; border-left: black 1px solid; border-top: black 1px solid; border-right: black 1px solid" /></a></p>
