<p align="center"><a href="/img/20180327/06becf40a34045bdb7e662a3e00eb119.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="小米游戏本图赏：3+2大直径加粗热管 散热给力" src="/img/20180327/s_06becf40a34045bdb7e662a3e00eb119.jpg" style="border-bottom: black 1px solid; border-left: black 1px solid; border-top: black 1px solid; border-right: black 1px solid" /></a></p>
<p align="center"><a href="/img/20180327/89c1661ad463433d98ece4cddda4a678.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="小米游戏本图赏：3+2大直径加粗热管 散热给力" src="/img/20180327/s_89c1661ad463433d98ece4cddda4a678.jpg" style="border-bottom: black 1px solid; border-left: black 1px solid; border-top: black 1px solid; border-right: black 1px solid" /></a></p>
<p align="center"><a href="/img/20180327/c92bb06c9baf489599bb77993d3dc4c1.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="小米游戏本图赏：3+2大直径加粗热管 散热给力" src="/img/20180327/s_c92bb06c9baf489599bb77993d3dc4c1.jpg" style="border-bottom: black 1px solid; border-left: black 1px solid; border-top: black 1px solid; border-right: black 1px solid" /></a></p>
<p align="center"><a href="/img/20180327/7b9d1663fbfe422d9790a56ae4d4aa99.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="小米游戏本图赏：3+2大直径加粗热管 散热给力" src="/img/20180327/s_7b9d1663fbfe422d9790a56ae4d4aa99.jpg" style="border-bottom: black 1px solid; border-left: black 1px solid; border-top: black 1px solid; border-right: black 1px solid" /></a></p>
<p align="center"><a href="/img/20180327/75802273d66545bd89b218aa0fd05eaa.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="小米游戏本图赏：3+2大直径加粗热管 散热给力" src="/img/20180327/s_75802273d66545bd89b218aa0fd05eaa.jpg" style="border-bottom: black 1px solid; border-left: black 1px solid; border-top: black 1px solid; border-right: black 1px solid" /></a></p>
<p align="center"><a href="/img/20180327/b35db0b0cdd6475eae2303958b67e1f7.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="小米游戏本图赏：3+2大直径加粗热管 散热给力" src="/img/20180327/s_b35db0b0cdd6475eae2303958b67e1f7.jpg" style="border-bottom: black 1px solid; border-left: black 1px solid; border-top: black 1px solid; border-right: black 1px solid" /></a></p>
<p align="center"><a href="/img/20180327/f19a60b317564d1a9b2405029f1eaf48.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="小米游戏本图赏：3+2大直径加粗热管 散热给力" src="/img/20180327/s_f19a60b317564d1a9b2405029f1eaf48.jpg" style="border-bottom: black 1px solid; border-left: black 1px solid; border-top: black 1px solid; border-right: black 1px solid" /></a></p>
