<p style="text-align: center"><img alt="《孤岛惊魂5》三平台画面对比 PC高帧率/远景赢了" src="/img/20180327/9bd82ce4-39b0-4274-965d-08f9d5423406.jpg" style="border-right: black 1px solid; border-top: black 1px solid; border-left: black 1px solid; border-bottom: black 1px solid" /></p>
<p style="text-align: center"><img alt="《孤岛惊魂5》三平台画面对比 PC高帧率/远景赢了" src="/img/20180327/44e47276-6758-4a69-90c9-4bca4f54fbba.jpg" style="border-right: black 1px solid; border-top: black 1px solid; border-left: black 1px solid; border-bottom: black 1px solid" /></p>
